        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "While its predecessor, Spirit Hunter: Death Mark, found its spirits in distinct, horrifying locales, Spirit Hunter: NG weaves fear seamlessly into the mundane. Face down monsters in quiet residential streets, neighborhood parks, and even the protagonist’s own home. Be careful—terror lurks behind every corner.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mientras que su predecesor, Spirit Hunter: Death Mark, situaba a sus espíritus en lugares distintos y horripilantes, Spirit Hunter: NG entrelaza el miedo con lo cotidiano. Enfréntate a monstruos en tranquilas calles residenciales, parques de barrio e incluso en el propio hogar del protagonista. Cuidado: el terror acecha tras cada esquina.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2018",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
