          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The third game in the Spirit Hunter series.\n\nThe story is set in a suburb of H City in Tokyo and revolves around Konoehara Academy, a school where gruesome events occur every ten years. The police are unable to explain the incidents, and classify them as accidents but they are rumored to be caused by spirits. Because of this, Konoehara's principal hires Kazuo Yashiki of the Kujo family to infiltrate the school as a teacher and investigate the incidents.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La tercera entrega de la serie Spirit Hunter.\n\nLa historia transcurre en un suburbio de H City, en Tokio, y gira en torno a la Academia Konoehara, una escuela donde cada diez años ocurren sucesos macabros. La policía no puede explicar los incidentes y los clasifica como accidentes, pero se rumorea que están causados por espíritus. Por ello, el director de Konoehara contrata a Kazuo Yashiki, de la familia Kujo, para infiltrarse en la escuela como profesor e investigar los sucesos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2022",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
